{
  "info": {
    "name": "SneakHub API",
    "description": "Collection API SneakHub (Go Fiber).\n\nSetup:\n1. Jalankan server (go run main.go)\n2. Ganti variable `base_url` sesuai kebutuhan (default http://localhost:3000)\n3. Register/Login -> token otomatis tersimpan di variable `token`\n\nMode payment di .env: mock | tripay | midtrans",
